        "original_id": "e6ccf490-d1bb-5b9b-8f96-1523086965e8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thornton Wilder, Richard Llewellyn\n- Works: The Long Christmas Dinner\n- Roles: Playwrights, novelists\n- Topics: American literature, British literature\n\nFacts:\n- Thornton Wilder was born on April 17, 1897, and he was an American playwright and novelist.\n- Richard Llewellyn was born on December 8, 1906, as Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd, and he was a British novelist who used the pen name Richard Llewellyn.\n- In 1931, Thornton Wilder wrote The Long Christmas Dinner as a one-act play.\n- Thornton Wilder died on December 7, 1975.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on November 30, 1983.",
